TI  - RDHNet: Reversible Data Hiding Method for Securing Colour Images Using AlexNet and Watershed Transform in a Fusion Domain
PY  - 2025
T2  - CAAI Transactions on Intelligence Technology
VL  - 10
IS  - 5
SP  - 1422
EP  - 1445
