AB  - The proceedings contain 114 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Advanced Computing, Networking and Informatics. The topics include: How meta-heuristic algorithms contribute to deep learning in the hype of big data analytics; using games to solve challenging multimedia problems; effective image encryption technique through 2D cellular automata; a dynamic model to recognize changes in mangrove species in sunderban delta using hyperspectral image analysis; a content-based visual information retrieval approach for automated image annotation; hand gesture-based stable powerpoint presentation using kinect; wavelet statistical feature selection using genetic algorithm with fuzzy classifier for breast cancer diagnosis; least square based fast denoising approach to hyperspectral imagery; image forgery detection using co occurrence-based texture operator in frequency domain; color components clustering and power law transform for the effective implementation of character recognition in color images; grayscale image enhancement using improved cuckoo search algorithm; segmentation of tomato plant leaf; a novel image steganography methodology based on adaptive PMS technique; defect identification for simple fleshy fruits by statistical image feature detection; extraction of FECG signal based on blind source separation using principal component analysis; an improved method for text segmentation and skew normalization of handwriting image; enhanced mutual information-based multimodal brain MR image registration using phase congruency; enhanced super-resolution image reconstruction using MRF model; signature classification using image moments and a Bengali handwritten vowels recognition scheme based on the detection of structural anatomy of the characters.
