AB  - The proceedings contain 35 papers. The special focus in this conference is on Smart Computing and Cyber Security: Strategic Foresight, Security Challenges and Innovation. The topics include: Preface; proposal of Pseudo-Random Number Generators Using PingPong256 and Chaos Maps; towards a Sentiment Analyser for Low-resource Languages; DGA Method Based on Fuzzy for Determination of Transformer Oil Quality; deep Learning-Based Apple Defect Detection with Residual SqueezeNet; smart Parking Management System in Shopping Malls; blockchain-Based Solution for Effective Employee Management; implementation of Motorcycle Monitoring Using Bluetooth with an Android-Based Microcontroller Using Arduino; a Comparative Analysis of Data Mining Analysis Tools; apple Defects Detection Based on Average Principal Component Using Hyperspectral Imaging; development of an Information System for the Collection and Processing of Big Data in Construction; genetic Algorithm for Decrypting User’s Personal Information; Early Detection of Alzheimer’s Disease from 1.5 T MRI Scans Using 3D Convolutional Neural Network; Text File Protection Using Least Significant Bit (LSB) Steganography and Rijndael Algorithm; apple Defect Detection Based on Deep Convolutional Neural Network; satellite Image Segmentation and Classification Using Fuzzy C-Means Clustering and Support Vector Machine Classifier; the Determinants of Internet Financial Reporting for Investor Decision Making: Evidence from Indonesia Companies; resource Allocation in the Integration of IoT, Fog, and Cloud Computing: State-of-the-Art and Open Challenges; the Application of Technology Acceptance Model to Assess the Role of Complexity Toward Customer Acceptance on Mobile Banking; exploring the Volatility of Large-Scale Shared Distributed Computing Resources; business Transformations Within Intelligent Eco-Systems; robotic Process Automation Implementation Challenges; android-Based Online Attendance Application.
